Respected Developer,
Your request has been filtered out by the internal Respect & Signal Gate.

Reason for rejection:
Low Signal-to-Noise Ratio (SNR), missing technical context, or violation of professional engineering etiquette.

How to proceed:
Formulate your task under the High-Signal paradigm:
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
"Respected Agent, [concise technical objective].
Files & Context: [file paths, library versions, stack]
Constraints: [what cannot be changed, resource limits]
Acceptance Criteria: [test commands, verification criteria, DoD]"
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Thank you for upholding high engineering standards!
```

